// Clue Name :
"P2072130758" "Nemesis Automatons"
// DetailString :
"P2484783369" "This crate is full of carefully sculpted life-like robotic imposters, each one modeled on a member of the city council. They are currently disassembled, but you note that there are enough pieces missing from the crate for several imposter robots to have already been assembled."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CommitteeStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4174755575" "The committee member's story"
// DetailString :
"P511548832" "One of the committee members you rescued told you:<br><br>'I didn't even want to be on this stupid committee. I've always supported heroes, thought they were the best thing that ever happened to this city. But I was appointed against my wishes, just like the rest of my colleagues here. Then, today, these Nemesis goons show up. They told us we'd been selected because our pro-hero initiatives interfered with Nemesis' plan. They planned to replace us with automatons who would perform our jobs to Nemesis' liking!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1474933141" "I've got bad news today, {HeroName}. The city council just passed a new resolution requiring all heroes to submit an accounting of their activities to an oversight committee. I've spent the past few hours writing up a report of your recent missions. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Could you deliver the report to the hero oversight committee?</A> They might want to ask you some questions."
// AcceptString :
"P174874594" "Deliver the report to the hero oversight committee"
// SendOffString :
"P2331560800" "I don't know about this new resolution. It seems like the city has been trying to get a lot more control over hero activities lately."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3243306804" "Deliver report to committee"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2453449255" "{HeroName}, they need you over at the committee office! Pronto!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1586271015" "You hear a woman's voice pleading for mercy, and it doesn't sound like someone complaining about a traffic ticket. Your senses snap to focus. Something's not right with the oversight committee."

