"P2765505589" "I had no idea that Nemesis could secretly hold such power within the city government. He hand-selected that committee, then tried to replace them with automatons! It's absolutely diabolical, and classic Nemesis technique. Another good indication that this is could be the original Prussian Prince of Automatons and not an imposter. Either way, Nemesis may well be the greatest threat Paragon City has ever faced."
