// IntroString :
"P1138997726" "Nemesis just deployed one of his Macro Assemblers in the Yellow Rose Cosmetics office building. Have you ever seen one of those machines, {HeroName}? It starts out about the size of a dump truck, but once it's deployed, it breaks itself up into all sorts of smaller machines. Then it proceeds to eat the building from the inside out! It breaks down any materials it finds and uses them to construct a new building, one to Nemesis' specifications. It will even break down people if it encounters them! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to stop Nemesis' Macro Assembler.</A> You only have 90 minutes to stop it. What's more, the machines are interconnected and can only be deactivated simultaneously. <color orange>So you'll need at least three teammates.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3994331145" "Stop Nemesis' Macro Assembler"
// SendOffString :
"P1003622332" "There may still be people in that building. You've got to get them out of there before they're rendered into glue!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2602483355" "Defeat Nemesis troops, machines"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2727307398" "If you don't get over there soon, that building will be beyond repair."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
