// IntroString :
"P2428800229" "I just learned that the Rikti are raiding a Council base today. Apparently they got word that the Council has stolen some of their biotechnology and is planning to use it to enhance their soldiers. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over there and stop the violence between the Council and the Rikti right away.</A> This is a scary situation, {HeroName}, and I've got a bad feeling about it. I feel that if things don't go well, this one may be a failure."
// AcceptString :
"P863566241" "Stop the violence between the Council and the Rikti"
// SendOffString :
"P3671398097" "Please hurry, {HeroName}. If you don't get there soon, the violence could endanger the lives of our citizens."
