"P575658108" "You defeated the Rikti and the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4259901224" "You failed to stop the violence before it spilled out into the streets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3714746681" "So the Council claimed to be completely innocent of stealing from the Rikti? Not surprising, but, based on the presence of Nemesis, I'm inclined to believe them. I've heard before that Nemesis has set groups against one another in order to learn the strengths and weaknesses of their technology. I'll bet anything that's what he's done here. And who do you think actually has that stolen tech? Why, Nemesis, of course."
// RandomFameString :
"P4224979158" "{HeroName} defeated the Rikti, the Council, and Nemesis all at once!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P540166476" "The police were able to quell the violence before it got too out of hand; the neighborhood took some property damage, but luckily no one was killed. And I've learned something valuable, {HeroName}, something you should hear. The Council never stole that biotechnology from the Rikti. This whole battle was engineered by Nemesis! He set the Rikti against the Council so he could judge the strength of their technology. What a cruel and twisted mind."
// RandomFameString :
"P2200180772" "My restaurant will be closed for a week; I've got to repair the damage caused by the Rikti and the Council."

