// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GasMasks 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2468979504" "Gas masks"
// DetailString :
"P86001495" "You found these gas masks in a warehouse, awaiting delivery to Nemesis. In the 1940's Nemesis almost seized control of America by releasing a special nerve gas in dozens of cities and then holding the country ransom for the cure. His robotic armies were only barely defeated on the streets of Washington DC by a coalition of heroes and a cure for the gas was synthesized in time, but the memory of his nearly successful plot still strikes fear in the hearts of many Americans."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Gas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3031150860" "Canisters of gas"
// DetailString :
"P1273305187" "These canisters of gas are marked in several places with black and orange hazard warnings. You wonder if the gas in these cylinders could be related to the same neurotoxin the original Nemesis used in his 1945 attempt to take over the United States."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2844735347" "I've got a mission for you, {HeroName}, very hush-hush. I just got word that a local warehouse is storing a bunch of arms and equipment for the Nemesis Army. I've spoken to the foreman, and he's agreed to let you take a quick look around. If we can figure out what Nemesis' next big move is, it'll go a long way toward preventing it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to check that warehouse for anything that might hint at Nemesis' plans.</A> <br><br>We still don't know for certain that this new Nemesis is the real 'Prussian Prince of Automatons' who's terrorized the world for nearly 200 years. Whether this new Nemesis and his army is the original or a some kind of imposter, they're extremely dangerous. Be careful on this one, {HeroName}."
// AcceptString :
"P4125223804" "Check the warehouse for anything that might hint at Nemesis' next plan"
// SendOffString :
"P2408571917" "If you find anything interesting, report back to me at once."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Compound1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4003251767" "Seek clues to Nemesis' plan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P495571091" "We have only a limited window of opportunity here. If Nemesis moves that stuff, our chance will be gone."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P298783319" "You hear the marching of soldiers' feet. Nemesis' men are here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3675400774" "Will the hero come?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4180831923" "Of course. Nemesis guaranteed it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1696007219" "Aha! {HeroName}, at last!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OBJECT_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// OBJECT_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1247050043" "Gas tank"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OBJECT_ENTITY 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_OBJECT_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_OBJECT_DIALOG :
"P1066818824" "Just puncture these things, and the whole city block should go down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_ATTACK_OBJECT_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_ATTACK_OBJECT_DIALOG :
"P4241031611" "Roger that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_HERO_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_HERO_DIALOG :
"P4071700044" "Don't let {HeroName} stop us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Gas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4141152954" "Prevent release of gas"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3211442665" "You confiscated the gas."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// Description :
"P3735302019" "crates to search"
// SingularDescription :
"P2364265052" "Search last crate!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P504381428" "You begin to open the crate."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P2557807414" "You have been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1981819548" "You have opened the crate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3520328332" "You found nothing of interest."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CrateClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SingularDescription :
"P1942495878" "Search the last crate!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2443292038" "You found some gas masks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2801505712" "After calling your contact, you receive instructions to talk to Phillipa Meraux, the counter-terrorism specialist."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3888832489" "Talk to Phillipa Meraux"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1105755809" "Phillipa knows a lot about the original Nemesis' first attempt to gas the U.S. If he's at it again, she's the one to look to for help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1217603735" "You can't outsmart Nemesis!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P542661583" "Sure, I can tell you all about Nemesis' first attempt to gas the United States. Not that it'll help. See, {HeroName}, I just don't believe he's actually playing the same tune again. That's not how the classic Nemesis operated. He was dangerously cunning, capable of running multiple interlocking plans at once, and he'd never try the same plan twice. From what I've seen of Nemesis this time, whether it's the original or not, I think he's just as capable and just as devious. You may not want to hear this, {HeroName}, but that whole warehouse mission was staged.<br><br>That's right, staged. I've done some digging on my own to confirm my suspicions, and lo and behold, the whole operation is gone. No foreman, no workers, nada. Face it, {HeroName}, Nemesis was trying to get you and {ContactName} so wrapped up in this fake plot, you'd never guess his real intentions.<br><br>Luckily, I've got another lead you can follow up. I don't know if this is something we can trust, but I heard that there's a lot of activity in a nearby Nemesis base. If you'll check that out, I'll bet we find he's on to a whole different scheme."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3549482024" "Check out Nemesis base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4177419040" "Phillipa may be right about that base; you should check it out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3426322373" "Nemesis will play you for a fool, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1920776663" "The high-tech machinery of this base all bears the stamps of Nemesis' manufacture. It boggles the mind to imagine a man so gifted in so many sciences, yet so resolutely evil."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Portal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1403709812" "Portal generator"
// Description :
"P479329205" "Seek clues to Nemesis' plans"
// InteractBeginString :
"P989995386" "You begin to destroy the portal generator."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2487558099" "You have destroyed the portal generator."
// InteractActionString :
"P3365161279" "Destroying..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P96676726" "You defeated the villains and discovered that Nemesis has portal technology."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3871454265" "So, Nemesis had a portal generator! No wonder he led us on a wild goose chase; he couldn't risk the possibility that we would learn he has portal technology. Not only is that highly illegal, it's also very, very worrisome. I hesitate to imagine the plots Nemesis might be concocting. Is he planning to bring in troops from an alternate dimension? To spread his army into another world? Maybe this new Nemesis is from another world? Or maybe the original Nemesis hid on another world during the Rikti War? There are an infinite number of possibilities, and I'm sure Nemesis is hard at work selecting the most sinister one. We'll have to be doubly on our guard from now on."
// RandomFameString :
"P136017086" "That Nemesis is sneaky, but I doubt he's smart enough to fool {HeroName}!"

