// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NemesisNote 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3305731531" "Note from Nemesis"
// DetailString :
"P2540287527" "This note is gracefully handwritten on fine parchment. It reads:<br><br>'It has come to my attention that you often work with {HeroName}, the mighty defender of Paragon City. This over-confidant buffoon of a hero holds so little threat to my operations that I openly challenge this champion to try and foil my latest plan. Have {HeroName} come to the location marked on the enclosed map. Not that I believe the pompous fool has a chance. <Br><br>'Cordially,<br>'Nemesis.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Artifact 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3636385681" "Strange necklace"
// DetailString :
"P2044222986" "You found this necklace in the Circle of Thorns base that Nemesis' note directed you to. At first glance, it appears to be nothing more than an ancient Chinese coin hung on a strand of dirty twine. But when you close your hand around it, you feel a slight pain, and you notice that the hairs on the back of your wrist begin to grow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Talisman 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1185772464" "Talisman of Cho Pao"
// DetailString :
"P533679892" "This necklace appears to be nothing more than an ancient Chinese coin hung on a strand of dirty twine. However, Azuria informed you that it is actually the Talisman of Cho Pao, a powerful Chinese sorcerer form the Shang dynasty. Its restorative powers may be enough to help Nemesis recover his human body. Nemesis was the one who tipped you off to the coin's location, and you have no doubt he is watching your every move."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P959117769" "You'll never guess what arrived at my door this morning. A note from Nemesis! He says we'll have our chance to foil his latest plan, if you'll investigate a nearby cave. It seems likely to be a trap, but we have to follow up on it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you check out the cave Nemesis mentioned?</A> I know it's dangerous. But I'd be grateful if you'd try."
// AcceptString :
"P2927994847" "Check out the cave Nemesis mentioned"
// SendOffString :
"P3359695636" "Toying with the authorities is one of Nemesis' trademarks. Be careful, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4025878347" "Defeat all villains in cave"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2195432608" "I need you to check out that cave, {HeroName}. Whatever is going on there is going to be big."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1205962956" "As you follow the directions in Nemesis' challenge, you find yourself not in a hidden technical fortress, but in the outskirts of the lost city of Oranbega, home of the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P960213493" "What was lost shall once again be whole!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1765249894" "The rite must be completed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2618871954" "{HeroName}! What are you doing here?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1649121195" "{HeroName} cannot be allowed to find the Talisman!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VICTIM_MODEL 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VICTIM_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// VICTIM_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1241907964" "Sacrificial victim"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - SACRIFICE_SACRIFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SACRIFICE_SACRIFICER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1451110399" "The sacrifice of this flesh will return our own!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1864926755" "No! No, please, no!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - SACRIFICE_SACRIFICER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SACRIFICE_SACRIFICER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2318163019" "You have no idea what you're interrupting!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SACRIFICE_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3546538297" "I'm in your debt forever, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Altar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P950630402" "Altar"
// Description :
"P4126978850" "Find clue on Nemesis"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2240805495" "You notice something on the altar."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1967946983" "You take the item."
// InteractActionString :
"P3600912939" "Looking..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1010794863" "You found a strange necklace."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3736830730" "I've had the original letter forwarded to some people in forensics, but here's a copy. He sure sounds like the old Nemesis, but don't take anything he says personally."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1269248394" "Though there was no sign on Nemesis' forces, you defeated the Circle of Thorns and saved a sacrificial victim from them. You also recovered an artifact. After calling your contact, you receive instructions to take the artifact to Azuria for examination."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Compound2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2891029986" "Take necklace to Azuria"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P504728341" "I'm sure Azuria can tell us why Nemesis was after that necklace."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2384672031" "Give us the talisman!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2365666378" "Nemesis wants that Talisman!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3194469101" "Hand it over at once!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4004144769" "Of course I recognize this necklace. It is the Talisman of Cho Pao, the powerful Chinese sorcerer. It has enormous restorative powers, which probably explains how Cho Pao lived to be 612. I'd guess the Circle was trying to recover their original bodies, the ones they lost so long ago. As for Nemesis, I wouldn't be surprised if he was after the exact same thing. You don't live to be 180 without taking some extreme measures; Nemesis has replaced large portions of his body with mechanical parts. No one's seen him in years, but even then he was little more than a brain inside a walking piece of machinery. It could be he's turned to magic to return his body to a human form.<br><br>You'll have to be very careful with this, {HeroName}. I don't even want to keep it in the MAGI vaults; Nemesis would know it was there, and he's clever enough to find his way in. No, best to take it to a safe house. I'll draw you a map."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Compound2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P896624457" "Defeat all villains in safehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3980700888" "You've got to get that talisman to a safehouse before Nemesis comes looking for it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3442374489" "So this ordinary looking abandoned warehouse is Azuria's safehouse. It looks like the villains aren't the only ones to find a use for such buildings."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P723156991" "Will he come?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P862734663" "Of course. Azuria is so predictable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2522997017" "Ah, what a speedy delivery!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4122036839" "Nemesis knows just how to play these clowns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P488534101" "Better that {HeroName} fight the Circle than us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3519837914" "I'll sign for that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2579563041" "Warhulk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P760410764" "You defeated the Nemesis soldiers and kept the Talisman of Cho Pao safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4011461704" "Nemesis must be fuming! He sent you to that cave hoping you'd recover the Talisman and deliver it right into his hands. Well, he was half right. Good work, {HeroName}. I have to tell you, Azuria's feeling a little embarrassed after sending you into that trap. The next time you see her, give her a kind word."
// RandomFameString :
"P1314770626" "Nemesis tried to trick {HeroName} into doing his dirty work for him. Fortunately, {HeroName}'s too smart for that!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2468413603" "We've been getting a lot of reports of Nemesis soldiers harassing the civilians in Crey's Folly. They pretend to be noble peacekeepers, but the truth is they're just a bunch of goons with their own best interests at heart. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to head over to Crey's Folly and make it clear that the armies of Nemesis aren't welcome.</A> Policing that zone is your affair, not theirs. Make sure you get that across."
// AcceptString :
"P1707589188" "Go to Crey's Folly and make it clear that the armies of Nemesis aren't welcome"
// SendOffString :
"P806517890" "Nemesis is a dangerous foe, {HeroName}. We can't let him entrench his armies in areas of the city like this."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P655330999" "Stop harassment of civilians"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P513060449" "Those Nemesis soldiers are still harassing anyone in Crey's Folly who looks at them cross-eyed. Get over there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P683297604" "You have discouraged the Nemesis soldiers from harassing civilians in Crey's Folly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1265444502" "Good job, {HeroName}. We have to keep on our toes in this battle against Nemesis. Believe me when I say that his evil machinations are beyond our wildest dreams."
// RandomFameString :
"P3222022143" "Did you see {HeroName} in Crey's Folly earlier? Nemesis never knew what hit 'em!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3308092967" "I know it's hard to believe, {HeroName}, but a lot of young men find the armies of Nemesis very attractive. Nemesis is powerful, brilliant, and the ideology he professes is respectable. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to Crey's Folly and defeat as many Nemesis soldiers as you can find.</A> Make sure people know that the armies of Nemesis aren't a valid career choice in this town."
// AcceptString :
"P2321727669" "Go to Crey's Folly and defeat as many Nemesis soldiers as you can find"
// SendOffString :
"P3339019329" "People just need an example to steer them away from danger."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P294572128" "Prevent people joining Nemesis"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1410134629" "I need you to make a bigger impression on Crey's Folly. Go defeat some more Nemesis soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3787092496" "You discouraged the people in this neighborhood from joining the armies of Nemesis."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2435296172" "Good work, {HeroName}. We've got a lot of good young men in this town; we can't let them fall prey to Nemesis' deceptions."
// RandomFameString :
"P773029827" "I saw {HeroName} busting up some Nemesis jokers. Man, who'd ever want to be one of them?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_Nemesis_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1012672541" "Nemesis has been trying to change the way people think about him. He wants to position himself not as world-conquering tyrant, but as a benevolent champion of the people, and at the same time he has his men on the streets with standing orders to attack well known heroes as, and I quote, 'Menaces to public order, decency, and morality,' end quote. The people of Paragon love their heroes, {HeroName}, and after all of the times you've saved the city you have a lot of credibility. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If people see that you are fighting Nemesis' activities, it would help to combat any positive opinion of him.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P652042742" "Combat Nemesis forces to show the people your opinion"
// SendOffString :
"P2036158471" "People just need an example to steer them away from danger, and people in Paragon look up to you. Knowing that Nemesis is an enemy of yours will help to change a lot of minds. You can do that by foiling his plans or just by battling his forces in places like Crey's Folly and Eden."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4087869499" "Combat Nemesis menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4159589306" "I'm working to get the word out against Nemesis, but I need you to provide more public examples. Keep fighting the good fight against the Prussian Prince of Automatons."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2935783746" "You defeated enough Nemesis soldiers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P823914262" "Whether this is the original Nemesis or a usurper to his legacy of menace, I have to wonder why he's so focused on changing public opinion and making himself seem like a good guy. He'll have a hard time doing that with real heroes like you around, though."
// RandomFameString :
"P428597822" "{HeroName}'s through playing nice with Nemesis!"
